"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"Infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S2E35_Hoffman_Fireswarm.png","value_text":"File:S2E35_Hoffman_Fireswarm.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Violet <br> Black","value_text":"Violet \n Black","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"The Professor's Elite [[Suits]] <br> [[Kiel]] <br> [[Marduk]] <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Harrison Fears]] <br> [[Hoffman]]","value_text":"The Professor's Elite Suits \n Kiel \n Marduk \n Rassimov \n Harrison Fears \n Hoffman","links":[{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Marduk","label":"Marduk","target_id":"huntik:page:4648","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Marduk","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4648"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Hoffman","label":"Hoffman","target_id":"huntik:page:4577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hoffman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4577"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"","value_text":"\"The Divine Comedy\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"}]}],"start":0,"end":274}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[The Professor]]'s Elite [[Suits|Suit]] [[Beta]] used Fireswarm against [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n\n[[Hoffman]] used the spell against [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]] on [[Medusa's Island]], but she blocked it with her \"Double Parry\" ability. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}\n\n[[Marduk]] used Fireswarm against the Huntik team at [[The Cloisters]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\n[[Kiel]] used the spell against [[Sophie Casterwill]] who countered it with [[Chillskin]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}\n\n[[Kiel]] used the spell against [[Dante Vale]], who dodged it. {{source|The Spiral War}}\n\n[[Harrison Fears]] used Fireswarm to fight against [[The Organization]]'s [[Suits]] stationed at the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. He used it later to knock his brother [[Den Fears]] out of combat. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"The Professor's Elite Suit Beta used Fireswarm against Sophie Casterwill. [The Divine Comedy]\n\nHoffman used the spell against Powerbonded Sabriel on Medusa's Island, but she blocked it with her \"Double Parry\" ability. [Zhalia's Mission]\n\nMarduk used Fireswarm against the Huntik team at The Cloisters. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nKiel used the spell against Sophie Casterwill who countered it with Chillskin. [The Titan in the Temple of Sun]\n\nKiel used the spell against Dante Vale, who dodged it. [The Spiral War]\n\nHarrison Fears used Fireswarm to fight against The Organization's Suits stationed at the Tomb of Nefertiti. He used it later to knock his brother Den Fears out of combat. [Rassimov's Secret]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR= Déluge de feu\n|POR=Vermes de Pólvora, Enxame de Fogo}}","text":"French: Déluge de feu\nPortuguese: Vermes de Pólvora, Enxame de Fogo"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nS1E25 Beta Fireswarm.jpg|[[Beta]] using Fireswarm\nS2E40 Dante Kiel Fireswarm.png|[[Dante Vale]] dodging [[Kiel]]'s Fireswarm\nS2E47 Harrison Fireswarm.png|[[Harrison Fears]] using Fireswarm\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Black-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"S1E25 Beta Fireswarm.jpg|Beta using Fireswarm\nS2E40 Dante Kiel Fireswarm.png|Dante Vale dodging Kiel's Fireswarm\nS2E47 Harrison Fireswarm.png|Harrison Fears using Fireswarm"}],"full_text":"Fireswarm is a fire-based attack that manifests as a series of dark embers surrounded by a violet aura. This spell is similar in functionality to the Firestorm spell.\n\n== History ==\nThe Professor's Elite Suit Beta used Fireswarm against Sophie Casterwill. [The Divine Comedy]\n\nHoffman used the spell against Powerbonded Sabriel on Medusa's Island, but she blocked it with her \"Double Parry\" ability. [Zhalia's Mission]\n\nMarduk used Fireswarm against the Huntik team at The Cloisters. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\nKiel used the spell against Sophie Casterwill who countered it with Chillskin. [The Titan in the Temple of Sun]\n\nKiel used the spell against Dante Vale, who dodged it. [The Spiral War]\n\nHarrison Fears used Fireswarm to fight against The Organization's Suits stationed at the Tomb of Nefertiti. He used it later to knock his brother Den Fears out of combat. [Rassimov's Secret]\n\n==International Names==\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E25 Beta Fireswarm.jpg|Beta using Fireswarm\nS2E40 Dante Kiel Fireswarm.png|Dante Vale dodging Kiel's Fireswarm\nS2E47 Harrison Fireswarm.png|Harrison Fears using Fireswarm","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox_spell\n| image = File:S2E35_Hoffman_Fireswarm.png\n| aura  = Violet <br> Black\n| class = Offensive\n| users = The Professor's Elite [[Suits]] <br> [[Kiel]] <br> [[Marduk]] <br> [[Rassimov]] <br> [[Harrison Fears]] <br> [[Hoffman]]\n| first = \"[[The Divine Comedy]]\"\n}}'''Fireswarm''' is a fire-based attack that manifests as a series of dark embers surrounded by a violet aura. This spell is similar in functionality to the [[Firestorm]] spell.\n\n== History ==\n[[The Professor]]'s Elite [[Suits|Suit]] [[Beta]] used Fireswarm against [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}\n\n[[Hoffman]] used the spell against [[Sabriel|Powerbonded Sabriel]] on [[Medusa's Island]], but she blocked it with her \"Double Parry\" ability. {{source|Zhalia's Mission}}\n\n[[Marduk]] used Fireswarm against the Huntik team at [[The Cloisters]]. {{source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\n[[Kiel]] used the spell against [[Sophie Casterwill]] who countered it with [[Chillskin]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}\n\n[[Kiel]] used the spell against [[Dante Vale]], who dodged it. {{source|The Spiral War}}\n\n[[Harrison Fears]] used Fireswarm to fight against [[The Organization]]'s [[Suits]] stationed at the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. He used it later to knock his brother [[Den Fears]] out of combat. {{source|Rassimov's Secret}}\n\n{{clear}}\n==International Names==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR= Déluge de feu\n|POR=Vermes de Pólvora, Enxame de Fogo}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\" widths=\"185\">\nS1E25 Beta Fireswarm.jpg|[[Beta]] using Fireswarm\nS2E40 Dante Kiel Fireswarm.png|[[Dante Vale]] dodging [[Kiel]]'s Fireswarm\nS2E47 Harrison Fireswarm.png|[[Harrison Fears]] using Fireswarm\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Violet-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Black-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Black-aura spells","Blood Spiral magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Violet-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Marduk","label":"Marduk","target_id":"huntik:page:4648","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Marduk","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4648"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Hoffman","label":"Hoffman","target_id":"huntik:page:4577","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Hoffman","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4577"},{"target_title":"The Divine Comedy","label":"The Divine Comedy","target_id":"huntik:page:5040","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Divine_Comedy","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5040"},{"target_title":"Firestorm","label":"Firestorm","target_id":"huntik:page:5042","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Firestorm","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5042"},{"target_title":"The Professor","label":"The Professor","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Professor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"h